WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.265
Use a or an for singular unspecified count nouns and the for specific nouns. Other

00:00:06.265 --> 00:00:08.691
determiners express number, choice and reference.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:12.733
Which article completes “ blank orange”? Answer: an

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:17.800
Edit a paragraph using a, an, the, each, many, some and these appropriately.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.283
Why it works: Use an before a vowel sound.
